# DotApper CLI

Full reference: `AIRULES/02-DOTAPPER-CLI.md`.

## Rules

1. `Set-Location` to project root (`index.php` + `dotapper.php`)
2. Prefer generators over hand-written skeletons
3. `--module=` **before** `--create-controller|middleware|model`

## Common commands

```powershell
php .\dotapper.php --create-module=Shop
php .\dotapper.php --module=Shop --create-controller=Home
php .\dotapper.php --module=Shop --create-middleware=Gate
php .\dotapper.php --module=Shop --create-model=Item
php .\dotapper.php --list-routes
php .\dotapper.php --module=Shop --test
php .\dotapper.php --optimize-modules
```

## Interactive

`--install`, `--update`, `--prepare-database`, `--install-module` ask `[Y/n]`.  
Pipe `"y" | php ...` when automating. No `--yes` flag.

## Cannot generate

Libraries, view files (beyond scaffold), translation JSON, test PHP classes, cache clear, users/permissions CLI.

Judge success by printed messages and files created (exit code may be quirky — see AIRULES/15).
